   <text:h text:style-name="P1366" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117"/>Starviewer<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P411">Starviewer is a DICOM viewer that integrates image visualisation and evaluation tools for the diagnosis of medical images, reconstruction techniques, 3D navigation tools and <text:span text:style-name="T1096">image fusion </text:span>support. It adds functional modules and it can be integrated into hospital information systems such as PACS and RIS servers.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P411">Starviewer is made by:</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Taula15" table:style-name="Taula15">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Taula15.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Taula15.B"/>
