    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T1186">The following window appears</text:span>:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P645"><text:soft-page-break/>This tab shows the studies that are stored in the computer where users are working, and that have been retrieved from a PACS of from a DICOMDIR.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P645">In order to search in the local database different filters can be applied such as: patient name, patient ID, date of the study, <text:span text:style-name="T1188">and</text:span> modality.</text:p>
