       </draw:image>
      </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T786">S</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T168">end to</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T1"> PACS</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T168">It sends the selected studies or series to the selected PACS. This operation can also be performed by pressing the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">S</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T168"> keys. A dialogue box with the configured PACS appears from which the PACS where the selected elements will be sent can be chosen. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T169">Once the PACS have been selected, the submission is confirmed with the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T169">S</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T787">end</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T169"> button. If the PACS does not appear in the list, a new PACS can be configured (see section</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T61"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T61"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc41286_573806592">16.4</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T61"><text:s/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc41286_573806592">PACS</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T169">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="P422" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc7006_2613969985"/><text:soft-page-break/>PACS <text:span text:style-name="T1187">servers</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc7006_2613969985"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P647">In order to search for studies in one or several PACS servers, they can be accessed in two different ways:</text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="List_20_1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2378"><text:span text:style-name="T169">From menu</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Fi</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T787">le</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> &gt; </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T1">PACS…</text:span></text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2292"><text:span text:style-name="T169">With the shortcut</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T61"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T64">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64">+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T64">P</text:span></text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P648"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr52" draw:name="Imatge7" text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:width="17cm" style:rel-width="100%" svg:height="11.74cm" style:rel-height="scale" draw:z-index="304"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
