      </office:binary-data>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>To open a study from the RIS, users have to select the button of the study in the RIS. After that, the Starviewer application starts (if it was not previously opened) and a notification is shown that indicates that the search for the studies that have been requested from the RIS has begun.</text:p>
