    </draw:frame><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T69">I</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T176">n order to export studies, it is first necessary to select one or more studies (by holding down the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T69"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T69">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T69"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T176">key, non-consecutive studies can be selected) from the list, and then </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T355">right-</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T176">click </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T66"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T69"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T176">on one of the selected studies and choose the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T69"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T177">S</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T794">end</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T69"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T794">to DICOMDIR List</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T69"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T176">option in the contextual menu, or us</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T177">e</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T176"> the shortcut</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T70">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70">+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T70">M</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1652"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr11" draw:name="Imatge13" text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:width="17cm" svg:height="12.654cm" draw:z-index="310"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
