    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T180">Once we see the list of studies in the recording queue, we have to choose the corresponding option </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70">(</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T70">CD-ROM</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70"> o </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T70">DVD-ROM</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70">)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T180"> and click the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T70"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T70">Crea</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T180">te</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T180"> button.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P427"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T1197">The program that has been configured to create the CD or the DVD (whose configuration can be found in the</text:span> <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc41296_573806592">DICOMDIR</text:bookmark-ref><text:span text:style-name="T1197"><text:s/>configuration panel) automatically opens and the dis</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1412">c</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1197"> is burned.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P982" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc10641_2613969985"/><text:span text:style-name="T1197">Recording to hard disk or USB </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1015">flash drive</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc10641_2613969985"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P659">It is first necessary to follow the steps described in section<text:span text:style-name="T772"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T772"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc10635_2613969985">9.2</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T772"><text:s/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T772"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc10635_2613969985">Exportation of studies</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T773">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2036"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr11" draw:name="Imatge15" text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:width="17cm" svg:height="12.654cm" draw:z-index="312"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
