    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T198">We select another study as the current one by clicking its selection button in the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T199">Current</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T198"> column. Once opened, the viewer layout </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T199">predetermined by the new study </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T198">is applied.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P448"/>
