   <text:p text:style-name="P677"><text:span text:style-name="T1264">The viewer over which the mouse is moved while the left button is </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1266">held down</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1264"> or the mouse wheel is spun, or the active viewer while the keys are pressed.</text:span></text:p>
