    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T223">The</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T223">Custom</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T223">option (next to last in the drop-down menu) allows choosing the exact values of window</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T96"> </text:span><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__8092_253678565" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2019-12-04T17:59:40.904229006</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2560"><text:span text:style-name="T1462">En anglès ja tenim posat directament window width i window center, falta actualitzar la traducció en català i suposo que també en castellà.</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation><text:span text:style-name="T223">width and level</text:span><office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__8092_253678565"/><text:span text:style-name="T223">. When this option is selected, the following dialogue box appears to enter the values</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T96">:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1744"><text:span text:style-name="T223">Finally, the last entry,</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Edit </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T802">C</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T223">ustom WW/WL</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">,</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T223"> allows the definition of user windows as explained in the next section.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P472"><text:soft-page-break/>Vi<text:span text:style-name="T1114">ewer where it is applied</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P471"><text:span text:style-name="T1274">The active viewer (with the blue frame)</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P987" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc11388_253678565"/>User defined windows<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc11388_253678565"/></text:h>
