   <text:p text:style-name="P472">Func<text:span text:style-name="T1275">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1115">on</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P471">It allows <text:span text:style-name="T1275">adding, editing and </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1276">removing</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1275"> user windows that can later be chosen with the default window selection tool (see previous section). These windows are saved until the user </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1276">removes</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1275"> them.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P472">Mode <text:span text:style-name="T1115">of operation</text:span></text:p>
