   <text:p text:style-name="P71">Func<text:span text:style-name="T1279">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1118">on</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P70">It inverts the <text:span text:style-name="T1280">grey or </text:span>colour scale of the image, that is, the blacks turn white, the whites turn black, the yellows turn blue, the blues turn yellow, <text:span text:style-name="T1280">etc</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P134">Shortcut</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1389"><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">I</text:span></text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P71">Mode <text:span text:style-name="T1119">of operation</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P475">Select the viewer where the colour <text:span text:style-name="T1280">inversion</text:span> has to be applied and press the <text:span text:style-name="T1280">toolbar button</text:span> or the shortcut.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P71">Vi<text:span text:style-name="T1119">ewer where it is applied</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P70"><text:span text:style-name="T1280">The active viewer (with the blue frame)</text:span>.</text:p>
