      </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T245">We draw an area</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T244"> in one of the viewers to save it. By opening the series selection menu (right click</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T103"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T103"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T103">)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T244"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T245">we see that the study has two series.</text:span></text:p>
