      </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T245">We click on the toolbar button, and in the dialogue box we give a name to the new series and we choose to export only the current image and not send it to any PACS. We click on</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Display"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Export</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
