   <text:h text:style-name="P515" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc14099_2856793398"/><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__138208_113917041" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Unknown Author</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2021-03-18T11:13:40.898000000</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2561"><text:span text:style-name="T1463">Sembla que en anglès es diu “TT-TG” (tibial-tuberosity to trochlear groove), ja que “TA-GT” significa “tuberositat tibial anterior - gola de la tròclea”.</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2561"><text:span text:style-name="T1463">Si es canvia, buscar i reemplaçar.</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>TA-GT<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__138208_113917041"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc14099_2856793398"/></text:h>
