   <text:p text:style-name="P534">Func<text:span text:style-name="T1313">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1144">on</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P763">It allows drawing an arrow.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P534">Mode <text:span text:style-name="T1144">of operation</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2069"><text:span text:style-name="T104">C</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T258">lick</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T104"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T67"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T104"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T258">on the starting point to begin drawing the arrow, and click</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T104"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T67"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T104"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T258">again on the ending point to finish it. The arrow</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T259">head</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T258"> is at the second point. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T259">A started arrow can be cancelled by pressing the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T104"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T104">Esc</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T104"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T259">key before setting the second point.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P517">Vi<text:span text:style-name="T1145">ewer where it is applied</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1778"><text:span text:style-name="T259">The viewer where the clicks</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T67"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T259">are made.</text:span></text:p>
