   <text:p text:style-name="P696">It changes the <text:span text:style-name="T1442">slice</text:span> plane of the images.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P147">Shortcuts</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1265"><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">1</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> (axial), </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">2</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> (sagit</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T264">t</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">al), </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">3</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> (coronal)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P865">Mode <text:span text:style-name="T1154">of operation</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1305"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Select the viewer where the reconstruction has to be changed and click</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T265"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T67"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T265"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">the corresponding icon. The image is immediately reconstructed with the selected plane.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P865">Vi<text:span text:style-name="T1155">ewer where it is applied</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P553"><text:span text:style-name="T1333">The active viewer (with the blue frame)</text:span>.</text:p>
