      </office:binary-data>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>The button is placed at the bottom-right corner of the viewers that display a fusion:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P593">Func<text:span text:style-name="T1358">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1171">on</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P594">It controls the <text:span text:style-name="T1358">contribution of</text:span> each <text:span text:style-name="T1358">individual </text:span>image to the final fused image. This allows see<text:span text:style-name="T1358">ing</text:span> only the primary <text:span text:style-name="T1359">image (balance 100%</text:span>–<text:span text:style-name="T1359">0%), only the</text:span> secondary (balance 0%–100%), or <text:span text:style-name="T1359">any combination in between</text:span> that <text:span text:style-name="T1359">makes one of the images contribute more to the final result than the other one</text:span>. <text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T1359">The initial balance is always 50%</text:span>–<text:span text:style-name="T1359">50%, so that both images have the same contribution to the final result.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P593">Mode <text:span text:style-name="T1172">of operation</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2086"><text:span text:style-name="T294">Click</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T129"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T67"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T129"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T294">on the button in a combined viewer; a slider will appear with which the balance can be adjusted to one side o to the other one.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P904">Vi<text:span text:style-name="T1173">ewer where it is applied</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1896"><text:span text:style-name="T295">The viewer whose button has been clicked</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T67"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1037"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr3" draw:name="Marc27" text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:width="17cm" style:rel-width="100%" draw:z-index="480">
