    </draw:frame>The spheres located on the lines indicate the rotation centre of the cutting planes.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P258"><text:soft-page-break/>The MPR 2D viewer also has different calculation tools:</text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="List_20_1">
    <text:list-item>
