    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T1370">There are several default rendering styles that combine a transfer function (colour and opacity scale) with a set of parameters that affect the 3D rendering (mainly </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1371">lighting</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1370"> parameters). The available default rendering styles are the following ones:</text:span></text:p>
