    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T306">To clip on one face, click and hold down the left </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T356">mouse </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T306">button</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T134"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T134"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T306"> on the ball of the corresponding face and drag it. This allows moving the plane along its normal.</text:span></text:p>
