    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T307">To scale the box, click and hold down the right </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T356">mouse </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T307">button</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T134"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T66"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T307"> on the box or one of the balls, and drag up to expand the box or down to reduce it.</text:span></text:p>
