    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T308">To move the box, click and hold down the middle </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T357">mouse </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T308">button or the wheel</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T89"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T308">on the box or one of the balls, and drag it in the desired direction.</text:span></text:p>
