       </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="Caption_20_characters"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Figur</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Caption_20_characters"><text:span text:style-name="T1223">e</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Caption_20_characters"><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Caption_20_characters"><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure25" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">26</text:sequence></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Caption_20_characters"><text:span text:style-name="T1">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T409">Clipping planes in action. Left: initial state after enabling the tool; the balls at the centres of the planes can be seen. Centre: moving a face (the one with a different colour and the red ball) to clip the volume. Right: final state after clipping and disabling the clipping planes tool to hide the box.</text:span></text:p>
     </draw:text-box>
    </draw:frame>Ex<text:span text:style-name="T1176">a</text:span>mple</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P613" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc16424_2479470819"/><text:span text:style-name="T1374">3D </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1083">r</text:span>ota<text:span text:style-name="T1083">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1083">on</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc16424_2479470819"/></text:h>
