   <text:p text:style-name="P612">Func<text:span text:style-name="T1374">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1176">on</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P785">It allows rotating a volume within a 3D viewer.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P155">Shortcut</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1915"><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Q</text:span></text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P865"><text:soft-page-break/>M<text:span text:style-name="T963">ode </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1176">of operation</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1918"><text:span text:style-name="T309">Drag the mouse while holding down the right button</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T66"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T309">to rotate the volume in the direction of the movement. If the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Ctrl</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T309">key is held down while dragging, a rotation is made around the axis perpendicular to the screen.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P612">Vi<text:span text:style-name="T1176">ewer where it is applied</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P785">The 3D viewer.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P612"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr4" draw:name="Marc29" text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:width="17cm" style:rel-width="100%" draw:z-index="497">
