    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T135">When clicking </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T134"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> on </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T309">one of the menu’s elements</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T309">certain</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> information (</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">as</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> configured) </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">will be</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> transmitted from the active viewer to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">the corresponding</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> application. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">This allows</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">external </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135">application </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">to</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135"> know the current working context and act properly (for example, by showing the same study </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T310">that is </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T135">opened in Starviewer).</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P613" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc16428_2479470819"/><text:soft-page-break/><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__16416_2479470819" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2020-01-20T19:22:30.815992001</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2560"><text:span text:style-name="T1463">TODO pendent secció sobre l’extensió pdf</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2560"><text:span text:style-name="T1463">També potser millor donar més entitat a les altres extensions, que no estiguin a l’alçada de simples eines dins de la secció de visualitzaicó avançada</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2560"><text:span text:style-name="T1463">De fet això és el que es fa amb el dicom print</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2560"><text:span text:style-name="T1463">També mirar si falta quelcom més</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>PDF<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__16416_2479470819"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc16428_2479470819"/></text:h>
