    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T1388">For each viewer or extension opened from this menu, a new tab appears. If the selected element is already open</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1389">ed</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1388">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1389">the corresponding tab is activated; a new one is not opened.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P1510" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc24542_1084088360"/>Tools<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc24542_1084088360"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P730">This menu includes several functionalities not related to opening or visualising images.</text:p>
   <text:list xml:id="list151013329643071" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="List_20_1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2401"><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T329">L</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T832">anguage</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T329">it allows changing the language of the application. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T330">After changing the language it is necessary to close and reopen Starviewer to implement the change</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2401"><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Configura</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T833">t</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T1">i</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T833">on</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T330">it opens the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#1.13.Configuracions|outline" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T330">configuration window</text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2401"><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T330">R</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T833">un diagnosis</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T1"> tests</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T330">see section</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc4886_1692806117">13</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:s/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc4886_1692806117">Diagnosis tests</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P2402"><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T330">External applications</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T330">it allows running the</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#1.9.17.Aplicacions externes|outline" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T330">external applications</text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
