      </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="Citation"><text:span text:style-name="T330">Show patient identification in window title</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T330">it allows enabling or disabling the option of displaying the name and identifier of the patient in the title bar of the current Starviewer window. It is independent for each window and enabled by default.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
