    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T331">It moves the Starviewer window to a specific screen. The menu shows the current screen configuration. By clicking</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Keyboard"><text:span text:style-name="T134"></text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T331">one of the displayed screens, the window is sent to the corresponding screen.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P623"/>
