     <text:p text:style-name="P2560"><text:span text:style-name="T1462">TODO posar el port abans que el timeout a la finestra i llavors actualitzar la imatge</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation><text:span text:style-name="T1035">L</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1408">ocal c</text:span>onfigura<text:span text:style-name="T1035">t</text:span>i<text:span text:style-name="T1035">on</text:span><office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__12267_2664754409"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41290_573806592"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P279">This tab allows configuring the connection settings of the local machine with the PACS servers.</text:p>
